# .gitignore
# Assignment: DSO202 A4 (GitOps delivery of the Task Tracker with Argo CD)
# Descriptor: 4.4.1 (secrets in a GitOps repository)
# Purpose: keep plaintext credentials and sealing-key backups out of Git.
# This file is a second line of defence only. Plaintext never belongs inside
# the repo folder in the first place; the sealing key lives in ../dso202-keys/.

# Plaintext credentials used once to create SealedSecrets
secrets-plain/
*-plain.yaml
*.env

# Sealing-key backups (must stay outside the repo; ignored in case of a mistake)
sealing-key*.yaml
*sealed-secrets-key*
*.key
*.pem
*.crt

# Helm build output
*.tgz
charts/*/charts/
charts/*/Chart.lock

# Editor and OS clutter
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
